{{ additional_guidance }}
{% endif %}
## Response format

Return one result per entry, in the order given, each with:
- `entry_id`: the id supplied with the entry
- `acceptable`: boolean
- `rationale`: one short sentence (<25 words) saying what is wrong, or why it is fine
- `issue_type`: one of {{ issue_types }} — omit when acceptable
- `severity`: `low`, `medium`, or `high` — omit when acceptable
{% if generate_suggestions %}- `suggested_text`: the spoken form, omitted unless unacceptable and you are certain
